,{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", after which it makes a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check (with a bonus of +2 or higher, determined by its cost and quality) that can be used only to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Improve Access"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Improve_Access"},". All Computer Spikes are considered ",{"tag":"a","children":["Illegal"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Illegal"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The quality of a Computer Spike is reflected in its cost, as every +2 bonus to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," checks increases the cost of a Computer Spike by 1,500 credits, as the side-table indicates.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
